sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Browser
    participant BE as Java Backend
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>BE: Open /flamegraph.html → Sync from GitHub
    BE->>GH: Fetch public issues
    GH-->>BE: Issues JSON
    BE->>BE: Classify → Metrics → WorldState
    BE-->>User: Flamegraph (stress + 3-3-3 plan)

    User->>BE: Open /checkin.html → Check My Stress
    BE->>BE: Calculate stress score + breakdown
    BE->>DB: Record snapshot
    BE-->>User: Score + breakdown + hover hints

    User->>BE: POST /demo/api/reshape
    BE->>BE: Supervisor → 5 sub-agents → mutation plan
    BE->>BE: Apply labels to IssueCache
    BE-->>User: Before/after scores

    User->>BE: Open /study.html → Load Data
    BE->>DB: Query snapshots
    BE-->>User: Trend chart + participant cards
